# PROVENANCE — infinity6c

SigmaStar Infinity6C (vendor CHIP = i6c), the SSC377 line. Kernel-side payload
and the runtime blobs the ISP and encoder read. Userspace is
johnchia/sigmastar-lib under the same family name and the same drop.

Kernel 5.10.61, not the 4.9.84 the other two families run. That is why this tree
is keyed by family rather than by kernel release -- see the top-level PROVENANCE.

Two drops are carried:

    kmod-5.10.61-0907-glibc-11.1.0/    22 modules
    kmod-5.10.61-0907-uclibc-9.1.0/    19 modules
    kmod-5.10.61-1230-uclibc-9.1.0/     1 module + 2 sensor drivers

    venc_fw/{0907,1230}/    iqfile/{0907,1230}/    sensor-iq/{0907,1230}/

`soc/sigmastar/infinity6c.mk` names the drop, C library and GCC version, and
sigmastar-lib must be indexed with the same three.

